{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32919","headline":"送僧之台州 · 李郢","name":"送僧之台州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独寻台岭闲游去，岂觉灵溪道里赊。\n三井应潮通海浪，五峰攒寺落天花。\n寒潭盥漱铜瓶洁，野店安禅锡杖斜。\n到日初寻石桥路，莫教云雨湿袈裟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}